    <briefdescription>
<para>Element of a JSON path. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It can be either string or number. String idenfiers are in [&quot;...&quot;] and between dots. Numbers are indexes in [...].</para><para>May be organized in a tree-like structure reflecting a JSON document structure, for more details see the comment to struct <ref refid="structjson__tree" kindref="compound">json_tree</ref>. </para>    </detaileddescription>
